# Compiled / generated kernel objects
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.o.*
*.a
*.ko
*.ko.*
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.cmd
.tmp_*/
*.dtb
*.dtbo
*.symvers
modules.order
modules.builtin*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local session / scratch notes (kept out of the upstream-facing tree)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/context.md

